# Synthetic Data Generation

## Required exports
- **RGB** frames
- **Segmentation** mask (pixel-perfect when possible)
- **Joints/bones ground-truth** per frame (JSON/CSV)
- (Optional) camera params (intrinsics/extrinsics)

## Naming/layout
- Use `seq_XXXXXX/` folders under a chosen `out/` root
- Standard subfolders: `rgb/`, `mask/`, `joints/`, plus `camera.json`

## Domain randomization knobs
- Camera: azimuth/elevation/distance/FOV
- Lighting: intensity/color/HDRI
- Materials: skin tone / gloves

